            "reviewBody": "truly scrumptious! I didn't have mint chocolate chips so used plain choc. chips and the recipie was still a HIT. When I ran out of mints I just made plain unadorned cookies rolled the dough in powdered sugar before baking and those were gobbled up too. This is a keeper! Thank you!"
