              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Littlestu"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Definately 5 stars for this recipe! It's just what I was looking for, a thin wafer cookie. Walmart had Andes Creme De Menthe baking chips and they were awesome. Followed the recipe to a T except I didn't have any chips left over to melt on top, didn't need it anyway. And by the way, 1 3/4 c chips was a 10 oz package. Watch your baking time since they're so thin they bake quickly. They're going to be a perfect addition to my Christmas baskets this year and years to come. Thanks for this recipe!",
